{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Freed from the imprisonment of your old life, you embark on a journey into the green forests of Topworld.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953610/extras/e41fcc316149adefc36b0567bdadb3ff.avif?t=1761347021\" data-has-big width=1560 height=344 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The woods might provide some old tools to help you find your way, but survival is not guaranteed. Can you uncover the secrets of the forest, master its magic, and rebuild what was once lost?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Magic seems to be spreading everywhere, and perhaps the old temple has something to do with it. There is a calling \u2014 the world needs someone to restore the ancient community and help it regain its former strength. If you can bring the temple back to life, the civilization that once thrived here can help you become the new hero of the woods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Topworld is full of opportunities, and this is just the beginning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Magical Skills:</strong> Teleport, unleash shockwaves, control a magic sphere, shape water to catch fish, and transform the land.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tools, Weapons &amp; Crafting:</strong> Wield a sword, bow, and shield to fight enemies. Equip armor. Use axes and pickaxes to gather resources. Craft items and trade gold to thrive in the forest.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ancient Temple &amp; Puzzles:</strong> Solve shrines and puzzles scattered across the world to restore the power of the ancient civilization.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mount &amp; Exploration:</strong> Ride your mount to traverse the forest and hunt for hidden treasures.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Own Village:</strong> Shape the land, place buildings, decorate, and make Topworld truly yours.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953610/extras/1ad5f127da4cb252323278a1e4db5906.avif?t=1761347021\" width=80 height=80 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953610/extras/95f5b1ef842f0f6de0791a11ba965a69.avif?t=1761347021\" width=96 height=128 /></span> \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953610/extras/8c7744a62e7764565efb9dc304560c62.avif?t=1761347021\" width=128 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Early Access Note:</strong> This game is currently being solo-developed. Saving isn\u2019t available yet, but you can explore and join the community now to help shape the game\u2019s future!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2953610?t=1761347021","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953610/6184c724f71076221e37ec0e53e954798eed4c37/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761347021","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953610/9f2b1b80bfe926d2affbb369358c41c49bf8399b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761347021","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953610/9f2b1b80bfe926d2affbb369358c41c49bf8399b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761347021","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"descrip